{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Among the nations</b> — in gematria: among the Babylonians. Among the nations (בגוים) — in gematria: and Media." "<b>He will drive</b> — in gematria: and Greece." "<b>There</b> — in gematria: from Rome. Behold, four exiles are alluded to here."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The gematria equates בעמים with בבבליים (with the prefixed bet reading as 'among') and בגוים with ובמדי; his arithmetic is preserved as written."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:08:47.893682838Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}